  "guid": "com.keyhunter.spt40",
  "name": "KeyHunter",
  "slug": "keyhunter",
  "teaser": "A mod that increases key spawn rates in jackets, duffle bags, and dead scavs without flooding the loot tables.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/rJIKcFhmLngovbhzJOhTv2jon1GlHHvdNOXWlicd.jpg",
  "downloads": 12667,
  "favourites_count": 43,
  "description": "<p>Tired of endlessly searching for keys?\nKeyHunter provides a smarter and more natural way to find keys and keycards while respecting Tarkov’s loot system.</p>\n<p>Inspired by the original KeysInLoot concept by MusicManiac, KeyHunter v2 introduces a fully reworked, dynamic implementation for SPT 4.x.</p>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Automatic key and keycard discovery directly from the game database</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Progression-based spawning – players at lower levels mostly encounter common keys, while rarer keys become available as progression advances</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Smart rarity system (Common, Rare, Super Rare, Keycards)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Optional map-based key routing – keys are more likely to appear on their associated maps</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Automatic price adjustments to reduce economic impact</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Configurable behavior without hardcoded key ID lists</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p>This version is a major rewrite and is not compatible with previous configurations</p>\n<h3>Please remove the old KeyHunter mod folder completely before installing v2</h3>\n<p>If you encounter any issues or unexpected behavior, feel free to leave a comment.</p>\n",
